      <h1 class="jr-h1">Exercises for Knee Pain: Which Ones the Trials Rank Highest</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Most knee pain articles hand you twelve exercises and no way to choose between them. This one ranks them by what forty-eight randomised trials measured, states how often you have to do them, and says plainly where a supplement does and does not belong.</p>

